  "seoBody": "<p>Quickler charges only for active users, not per seat. £20 per active user per month, with dormant users free. There is no time-limited trial; the free tier is how you start, with no card required.</p><h2>The plans</h2><p>[[price:bundles]]. The free tier gives you 20 reports a month, up to 10 photos per report, and unlimited users, free forever. On a paid account everything is unlimited: reports, photos, messages and workflows, and you pay £20 for each active user in the months they work.</p><p>Big team? <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">Talk to us</a>.</p><h2>Payment</h2><p>We collect by <strong>Direct Debit</strong>. You authorise once; we draw monthly in arrears from your bank account. No card numbers stored. You are protected by the Direct Debit Guarantee, so refunds are immediate if anything goes wrong.</p><h2>How the bill is calculated</h2><p>Each month you are charged £20 for every active user, meaning every person who produced at least one report that month. The first active user is always charged, so the minimum is £20 a month. Anyone who did not produce a report that month costs nothing.</p><h2>Upgrading from free</h2><p>When you outgrow the free tier of 20 reports a month, you add a Direct Debit and move to a paid account. Nothing changes about how your team works; the caps simply lift.</p><h2>Cancelling</h2><p>Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">hello@quickler.co</a>. Your subscription ends at the next billing date. Export your data first, see <a href=\"/pages/help/privacy.html\">Data and privacy</a>.</p><h2>Invoices</h2><p>Every payment generates an invoice emailed to your primary admin. Need a historical one resent? Email support.</p><p>Still stuck? Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">hello@quickler.co</a>, we reply within one business day.</p>",
